It is morning.
I stand in the hallway.
The caretaker is waiting for me.
He has something in his hand.
They are two keys.
"Here you go, here are the keys," he says and smiles.
I take the keys.
"Congratulations on the flat," he says.
I have my own flat now!
It is right next to my old room.
I walk over to my door.
I stand by the door with my key.
I put the key in the lock.
I open the door.
"My own flat," I say.
And then I go inside.
